  {
    "episode_id": 91897,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91897.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "You bet. I've got a lot to talk with you about. I guess I would start for the reason you're here, and I'm grateful for it, because we talked about this last week with the Deputy Director of the GOP, and it's an initiative that I know you're interested in. You guys in Florida run your elections very, very well. You've been famous for it lately. The GOP nationally has created something called BankYourVote.com, and I guess it's a two-prong question. Number one, yes, I want to find out about it. for people who don't know about the program yet but to if you can kind of enlighten us about the way you guys run elections in florida why it works so well what we can learn from it",
