    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "So our agency ballots are allowed to be counted 15 days prior to election day. So with all the mail-in ballots that come in, the supervisor of elections does have the ability to go through those ballots, process those ballots, and sequester those ballots, and sequester the results until election night.",
